- Study 32: Cross-trimester repeated measures of biochemical markers from first and second trimester
- Study 49: Comparison of contingent, step-wise and integrated screening combining first and second trimester markers
- Study 58: Comparison of first trimester combined test, second trimester triple test, and integrated test
